BABY! Here it is! The program you've all been (patiently (?) ) waiting
for... *** DOSamatic*** I must send my highest complements to Marin
Pacific Software Co. for creating this freeware masterpiece; it is
definitely among the top freeware programs for the IBMPC... For more
info, see my net.micro / net.micro.pc article 'Multitaskers (rather
